      <p>Because the festival mixes music with an art-and-installation component spread across the grounds, plenty of attendees arrive well before the headline sets purely to explore that side of the event first — a strategy that has the added benefit of avoiding the peak arrival crush most other festival-goers hit later in the afternoon.</p>
