      <p>Visitors who prefer to pair a River Road day with a different kind of Louisiana day trip sometimes ask about combining it with a <a href="/blog/swamp-tour-transfer-logistics-new-orleans-hotels">swamp tour</a> in the same visit — while the two areas are in different directions from the city and rarely fit into a single day comfortably, planning them as back-to-back day trips across a longer New Orleans stay is a popular way to see both sides of the region's landscape without rushing either one.</p>
