      <p>A published loop schedule also solves a problem individual rideshare requests create at scale — when a session breaks and two hundred attendees simultaneously need the same short trip between two nearby hotels, on-demand pricing and availability both suffer, exactly the kind of surge that a pre-scheduled shuttle circuit is specifically designed to absorb without anyone noticing a slowdown.</p>
